<title>CROATIA: SOCCER-CROATIA BEAT SLOVENIA 2-0 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CROATIA BEAT SLOVENIA 2-0 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>SIBENIK, Croatia 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Croatia beat Slovenia</p>
<p>2-0 (halftime 1-0) in a European under-21 soccer championship</p>
<p>group one qualifier on Thursday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Silvije Maric 32, 65</p>
<p>Attendance: 2,000</p>
<p>     Standings	P  W  D  L  F  A  Pts</p>
<p> Greece		 5  3  1  1  5  3   10</p>
<p> Croatia		4  2  0  2  5  4    6</p>
<p> Slovenia	     4  2  0  2  4  5    6</p>
<p> Bosnia		 4  1  1  2  3  4    4</p>
<p> Denmark		3  1  0  2  4  5    3</p>
</text>
